            <title>[IGNITE-15205] StandaloneWalRecordsIterator closes the kernal context used by Ignite node</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15205</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
